Call upon the legendary resilience of the Dwarven race to increase armour ([+7, +11, +17, +21, +25 (CON 10-100)]), armour hardiness ([+19%, +27%, +31%, +33%, +35% (TL1-5)]), spell ([+12, +15, +21, +25, +30 (CON 10-100)]) and physical ([+12, +15, +21, +25, +30 (CON 10-100)]) saves for 8 turns.

The bonuses will increase with your Constitution.
